{
  "_doc": "Per-directory rules. Placeholders {repo_url}, {owner}, {repo} are substituted in listed_check. A listed_check url returning 200 with `contains` (case-insensitive whole-token match; empty never matches) means listed. `listing_unknown` = site cannot be probed anonymously: report 'listing unknown', never listed. `_probe` records what was observed. Requirement ids are the checks in scripts/preflight.py.",
